  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Weaving hope: upgrading the Syrian Arab Republic&apos;s garment industry and workforce</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance the competitiveness and decent job creation potential of the garment supply chain, thus advancing industrial productivity and decent work conditions in Syria, while managing environmental impacts. The intervention will target the entire garment supply chain, from sourcing and production to export, through a comprehensive set of measures supporting economic, social, and environmental development. A particular focus will be placed on workers and employers# skills enhancement to improve the livelihood conditions of the ordinary Syrian people.</narrative>
  </description>
